// the rank-1 reflector apply touches ONLY the sub-block's own columns
// [s0, se). After the sub-block is done we build its IS x IS compact-WY T_s and
// apply (I - V_s T_s^T V_s^T) to the REST of the panel columns [se, ib) as one
