// eat a separate rank-1 update from each of these IS reflectors. This replaces
// the O(ib) serial rank-1 sweeps over the wide trailing region with O(ib/IS)
// blocked applies: a trailing panel column is now read/written ~2x per
// sub-block instead of IS times, cutting the dominant MIO smem traffic.
